~ terrible_ending
There's nothing you're good at
But there's one thing you're the very best at; having no street cred
Regretting the events of your day haunts you
There's been forever since the last successful dap-up
If you could do it all again, you'd make sure not to mess up this bad
=> END

~ bad_ending
Occasionally, you don't make a fool of yourself
But today was not one of those occasions
You're a real loser and nearly everyone knows it
There's so much you would change if you could do it all over again
=> END

~ neutral_ending
Sometimes you wish you could go back and change things
The awkward greetings
The missed dap-ups
The misunderstandings
If you could try all over again, you'd make sure not to make the same mistakes again
=> END

~ good_ending
Nobody's perfect but you get pretty darn close
Everything that could go wrong, went right
Every dap-up, every greeting and errand
Every word spoken word, gesture and eye contact
At the end of the day, there's nothing you'd change
You're a real one for this
=> END

~ bugged_ending
No one was supposed to get this ending... 
It means something went wrong in the game, woopsie!
=> END